<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia July gross wages rise 3.8 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Slovenia July gross wages rise 3.8 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Monday:</p>
<p>AVERAGE GROSS WAGES (changes in percent)</p>
<p>				 July	    June	    July 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change	  3.8	    -0.7		0.5</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change	   17.7	    13.4	     17.4</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
